Hi {Owner},

I build websites for collision and body shops around {City}. {Business Name} has strong before-and-after work and good reviews, but no site a driver finds right after an accident.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: an insurance claim walkthrough written for a shaken driver, a damage-upload estimate form, a paintless dent and hail page, and a before-and-after gallery sorted by repair, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

